    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/education-wda/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Meet the WordPress Education WDA theme, designed specifically for educational websites. In the age of digital-first experiences, schools, academies, institutes, and learning hubs need websites that reflect their mission, capture attention, and engage students (and parents) effectively. That’s where the WordPress Education theme comes in — a modern, elegant, and flexible WordPress template built to serve the needs of the education world. Here’s what makes this theme different from other WordPress themes: clean, professional aesthetic (the layout is visually balanced, letting your content shine — course descriptions, faculty profiles, event announcements — without clutter or distraction), modular homepage sections (Education WDA's homepage consists of independent blocks, such as the main banner, features, team, testimonials, etc., that can be rearranged, enabled, and adapted to fit your academic storytelling), responsive, mobile‑friendly, and SEO-optimized (the WordPress Education theme offers smooth display across screen sizes so your website visitors get a great experience whether they’re on desktop, tablet, or phone), built-in blog layouts, WooCommerce integration (if you want to sell course materials, uniforms, event tickets, or anything else, the theme is perfect for those purposes), customizable header, footer, colors &amp; typography, 14 ready-made patterns that can be used on any page, and much more. The WordPress Education theme is multifunctional, so it can be used for learning management systems (LMS), online courses, e-learning, campuses, schools, and other websites. The free version is good enough on its own, but the premium version offers even more features and capabilities. Having a polished, functional, and engaging website is essential for any educational institution, and our WordPress Education theme is the perfect solution. Whether you're launching a university site, school portal, online academy, or learning center, the right theme can make a world of difference. You can visit our demo site and see the theme in action, or install and test the free version to evaluate all its features and capabilities for yourself."
    },
